{"id":"https://api-collections.nypl.org/manifests/999d3890-b7bf-0133-81d7-3c07547a230f","type":"Manifest","label":{"en":["Ocean premiere: and performances at the Cirque Royal in Brussels, 1994-05-18/21"]},"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/presentation/3/context.json","metadata":[{"label":{"en":["Additional Titles"]},"value":{"en":["<span><b>Uniform:</b> Ocean (Choreographic work : Cunningham)</span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Collection"]},"value":{"en":["<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/collections/0ed4e240-509c-0136-8e2a-79e0a253f893'>Merce Cunningham Dance Foundation Collection. Audio materials</a></span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Names"]},"value":{"en":["<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bname%3DMerce+Cunningham+Dance+Company%5D'>Merce Cunningham Dance Company</a>  (Associated name)</span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bname%3DKosugi%2C+Takehisa%2C+1938-%5D'>Kosugi, Takehisa, 1938-</a>  (Instrumentalist)</span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bname%3DTudor%2C+David%2C+1926-1996%5D'>Tudor, David, 1926-1996</a>  (Instrumentalist)</span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bname%3DTamayo%2C+Arturo%5D'>Tamayo, Arturo</a>  (Conductor)</span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bname%3DAdams%2C+John+D.+S.%2C+1966-%5D'>Adams, John D. S., 1966-</a>  (Recording engineer)</span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bname%3DTudor%2C+David%2C+1926-1996%5D'>Tudor, David, 1926-1996</a>  (Composer)</span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bname%3DCulver%2C+Andrew%2C+1953-%5D'>Culver, Andrew, 1953-</a>  (Composer)</span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bname%3DCirque+royal+%28Brussels%2C+Belgium%29%5D'>Cirque royal (Brussels, Belgium)</a>  (Host)</span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bname%3DNederlands+Balletorkest%5D'>Nederlands Balletorkest</a>  (Performer)</span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Identifiers"]},"value":{"en":["<span><b>RLIN/OCLC:</b> 891588342</span>","<span><b>NYPL Catalog ID (bnumber):</b> <a href='https://www.nypl.org/research/research-catalog/bib/b20303664'>b20303664</a></span>","<span><b>Universal Unique Identifier (UUID):</b> 999d3890-b7bf-0133-81d7-3c07547a230f</span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Dates / Origin"]},"value":{"en":["<span>Date Created: <a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5BdateStart%3D1994-05-18%5D%5BdateEnd%3D1994-05-21%5D'>1994-05-18 - 1994-05-21</a></span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Notes"]},"value":{"en":["<b>Statement Of Responsibility:</b> music by Andrew Culver (after John Cage) and David Tudor.","<b>Content:</b> Contains the music for Merce Cunningham's Ocean (1994) that consists of the simultaneous playing of orchestral music, Ocean 1-95 by Andrew Culver, and live electronic music, Sounding: ocean diary by David Tudor. The compositional structure of Ocean 1-95 was originally created by John Cage and, after Cage's death, completed by Andrew Culver using Cage's ideas.","<b>Content:</b> Title, dates and location provided by cataloger based on handwritten notes on original DAT containers. Performers and collaborators provided by cataloger based on original performance program notes.","<b>Content:</b> Handwritten note on original DAT container no. 1: \"MCDC \"Ocean\" Premiere performance in Brussels ; Location: Cirque Royal, Brussels, Belgium ; May 18, 1994 ; 2x KM84 ; Recorded on Sony TCD-D10 498KHZ\". Handwritten note on original DAT container no. 2: \"MCDC \"Ocean\" performed on May 19, 94 ; Location: Cirque Royal, Brussels, Belgium ; Recorded on Sony TCD-D10 48KHZ\". Handwritten note on original DAT container no. 3: \"MCDC \"Ocean\" ; Brussels, May 20, 94 ; Location: Cirque Royal, Brussels ; Recorded on Sony TCD-D10 48KHZ\". Handwritten note on original container no. 4: \"Bruxelles #4\".","<b>Numbering:</b> Donor's inventory number: D107 - D110.","<b>Performers:</b> David Tudor, and Takehisa Kosugi, electronic musicians; Nederlands Balletorkest; Arturo Tamayo, orchestral direction; John D.S. Adams, audio collaboration.","<b>Venue:</b> Recorded in performances at the Cirque Royal in, Brussels, Belgium, 1994 May 18-[21].","<b>Acquisition:</b> Gift; Merce Cunningham Dance Foundation, 2011-2012."]}},{"label":{"en":["Physical Description"]},"value":{"en":["Extent: 4 audio DAT cassettes (364 minutes total) : digital, .3209 ips, 44.1 kHz, 16 bit, two track, stereo","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bnote%3DSound+quality+is+good%3B+there+is+brief+audience+applause+at+the+end+of+each+recording.%5D'>Sound quality is good; there is brief audience applause at the end of each recording.</a></span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Library Locations"]},"value":{"en":["<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/divisions/rodgers-and-hammerstein-archives-of-recorded-sound'>Rodgers and Hammerstein Archives of Recorded Sound</a></span>","Shelf locator: *LTD-A 723"]}},{"label":{"en":["Subjects"]},"value":{"en":["<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Btopic%3DAleatory+music%5D'>Aleatory music</a></span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Btopic%3DElectronic+music%5D'>Electronic music</a></span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Btopic%3DModern+dance+music%5D'>Modern dance music</a></span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Btopic%3DMusique+concr%C3%A8te%5D'>Musique concrète</a></span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Btopic%3DOrchestral+music%5D'>Orchestral music</a></span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Btitle%3DTudor%2C+David%2C+1926-1996.+Soundings%3A+ocean+diary%5D'>Tudor, David, 1926-1996. Soundings: ocean diary</a></span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Btitle%3DCulver%2C+Andrew%2C+1953-+Ocean+1-95%5D'>Culver, Andrew, 1953- Ocean 1-95</a></span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Title"]},"value":{"en":["Ocean premiere: and performances at the Cirque Royal in Brussels, 1994-05-18/21"]}},{"label":{"en":["Division"]},"value":{"en":["<span><a href='https://www.nypl.org/locations/lpa/rodgers-and-hammerstein-archives-recorded-sound'>Rodgers and Hammerstein Archives of Recorded Sound</a></span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Table Of Contents"]},"value":{"en":["Streaming file 1, May 18, premiere: Soundings: ocean diary / Tudor (David Tudor, Takehisa Kosugi) [and] Ocean 1-95 / Andrew Culver (Nederlands Balletorkest) |||| Streaming file 2, May 19: Soundings: ocean diary / Tudor (David Tudor, Takehisa Kosugi) [and] Ocean 1-95 / Andrew Culver (Nederlands Balletorkest) |||| Streaming file 3, May 20: Soundings: ocean diary / Tudor (David Tudor, Takehisa Kosugi) [and] Ocean 1-95 / Andrew Culver (Nederlands Balletorkest) |||| Streaming file 4, May [21]: Soundings: ocean diary / Tudor (David Tudor, Takehisa Kosugi) [and] Ocean 1-95 / Andrew Culver (Nederlands Balletorkest)"]}},{"label":{"en":["Genres"]},"value":{"en":["<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bgenre%3DMusic%5D'>Music</a></span>","<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Bgenre%3DLive+sound+recordings%5D'>Live Sound Recordings</a></span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Resource Type"]},"value":{"en":["<span><a href='https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/search/index?filters=%5Btype%3Dsound+recording%5D'>Sound Recording</a></span>"]}},{"label":{"en":["Rights"]},"value":{"en":["This item is protected by copyright and/or related rights. You are free to use this Item in any way that is permitted by the copyright and related rights legislation that 